			"Message": "build(Air): Rename library artifact to AirLibrary\n\nThis commit updates the `[lib]` configuration in `Cargo.toml` to explicitly set the library artifact name to `AirLibrary`.\n\nPreviously, the library name defaulted to the package name `Air`. This change explicitly distinguishes the compiled library output from the package namespace, preventing potential naming conflicts or ambiguity with the binary artifact. This ensures clear identification of the library component during the build process and within the Land ecosystem's dependency chain.",
